      "title_type": 1,
      "description": "Features:\nThis projector features 1280*720 physical resolution, maximum supports 1080P resolution, true color contrast ratio ensures excellent viewing experience, smooth and clear picture, more outstanding details.\nAdopt environment-friendly LED light source, diffuse reflection imaging, soft light, long time watching without fatigue.\n0.8M-3.8M projector distance, you can freely adjust according to your needs.\nMobile phone and projector can share the same screen wired or wirelessly.\nTrapezoidal correction, you can enjoy big screen by adjusting the distance when watching movies, playing games and singing.\nMultiple ports design, equipped with USB, AV, VGA and headphone jack to meet diversified office or entertainment needs.\n\nSpecification:\nProjection technology: LCD\nPhysical resolution: 1280*720\nSupported maximum resolution: 1080P\nBrightness: 8500/100ansi\nSupported color number: 16770K\nContrast ratio: 1000:1\nProjection size: 27-150 inches\nScreen column: 4:3/16:9\nProjector distance: 0.8M-3.8M\nThrow ratio: 1.4:1\nOptimal projection distance: 1.2-2.5M\nTrapezoidal correction: ±15°(Manual)\nBulb life: >30000 hours\nOperation mode: Manual/remote control operation\nInput interface: AV, USB, VGA\nOutput interface: Lound speaker, stereo headphone\nAudio file: Support MP3, WMA, AAC, etc.\nImages file: Support common format like JPEG, BMP, PNG, etc.\nVideo file: Support format like MP4, RMVB, AVI, RM, MKV, etc\nText reading: Support TXT format and auto flip\nSupported language: 23 languages, such as Chinese, Eglish, etc.\nPower: 50W\nItem size: 21 * 14.5 * 7.5cm /8.27 * 5.71 * 2.95in\n\nPacking list:\n1 * Projector\n1 * Remote control\n1 * AV cable\n1 * Adjustment knob\n1 * Power adapter\n1 * User manual",
